      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Certainly, here's a preliminary draft for your review:\n\n---\n\n**Press Release**\n\nSubject: Our Commitment to Passengers During Baggage Incident\n\nDate: [Insert Today's Date]\n\n[Airline Name] is deeply saddened to confirm a recent baggage incident affecting several passengers during our flights earlier today. We understand the inconvenience and distress caused to our valued customers and are actively collaborating with various agencies to locate the missing belongings. We urge those affected to contact our customer service center for assistance; our team is dedicated to assisting you at every step. We assure you, [Airline Name] remains committed to providing the highest quality service and maintains rigorous standards throughout such challenging circumstances. Further updates will be provided as more information becomes available.\n\nWarm regards,\n[Your Name]\n[Your Position]\n[Airline Name]\n\n---\n\nFeel free to review this and let me know if you'd like any revisions.",
